{"seq":2,"slug":"computerized-adaptive-testing","title":"计算机化自适应测验（CAT）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/psychometrics/modern-measurement/computerized-adaptive-testing","wordCount":1506,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"计算机化自适应测验-cat\">计算机化自适应测验（CAT）</h1><p>让一个数学高手做满满 60 道题，前 40 道他闭眼都对——这 40 道题对测量他的真实水平几乎毫无贡献，纯属浪费他的时间和注意力。计算机化自适应测验的核心洞见就是：每道题只有当它的难度逼近作答者的当前水平时才最有信息量，那就让计算机一边答一边估、实时挑出最该问的下一题。结果是用一半甚至更少的题量，达到同等甚至更高的测量精度。GRE、GMAT、许多临床与教育测评早已运行在这套机制上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-一个实时循环\">核心概念：一个实时循环</h2><p>CAT 不是一份固定的试卷，而是一段在作答者与题库之间运转的算法循环。它从一个初始能力估计出发，反复执行&quot;选最优题 → 作答 → 更新能力估计 → 判断是否停止&quot;，直到精度足够。理解 CAT 就是理解这个循环的每一环如何由项目反应理论支撑（IRT 基础见 <a href=\"item-response-theory\">项目反应理论</a>）。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  START[初始能力估计 θ0] --&gt; SELECT[选题:从题库挑&lt;br/&gt;在当前θ处信息最大的题]&#10;  SELECT --&gt; ADMIN[呈现题目,作答者作答]&#10;  ADMIN --&gt; UPDATE[更新能力估计 θ̂&lt;br/&gt;含标准误 SE]&#10;  UPDATE --&gt; STOP{满足停止规则?}&#10;  STOP --&gt;|否,SE仍偏大| SELECT&#10;  STOP --&gt;|是| FINAL[输出最终 θ̂ 与精度]\">flowchart TD\n  START[初始能力估计 θ0] --&gt; SELECT[选题:从题库挑&lt;br/&gt;在当前θ处信息最大的题]\n  SELECT --&gt; ADMIN[呈现题目,作答者作答]\n  ADMIN --&gt; UPDATE[更新能力估计 θ̂&lt;br/&gt;含标准误 SE]\n  UPDATE --&gt; STOP{满足停止规则?}\n  STOP --&gt;|否,SE仍偏大| SELECT\n  STOP --&gt;|是| FINAL[输出最终 θ̂ 与精度]</pre><h2 id=\"题库-cat-的弹药\">题库：CAT 的弹药</h2><p>CAT 的一切建立在一个预先标定好的题库（item bank/pool）上——库里每道题的 IRT 参数（难度、区分度等）都已在大样本上估出并放到同一量尺。题库的质量直接决定 CAT 能达到的上限：若题库在某个能力区段题目稀疏，落在该区段的作答者就选不到合适的题，精度无从谈起。</p>\n<p>因此优质题库要在整个目标能力范围内都有充足、难度分布均匀、区分度高的题目，尤其要在关键决策点（如及格线）附近加厚。题库还需持续维护——题目会因泄露、过时而退役，新题须经预试与参数标定后才入库，并通过等值（equating）保证新旧题在同一量尺上可比。</p>\n<h2 id=\"选题-每一步都挑最有信息量的题\">选题：每一步都挑最有信息量的题</h2><p>选题是 CAT 的引擎。最经典的准则是最大信息法：在当前能力估计 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{\\theta}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 处，从尚未作答的题里挑项目信息函数值最大的那道。回忆信息与精度的关系，测验信息越大、标准误越小：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mrow><munder><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></munder><msub><mi>I</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msqrt></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SE(\\hat{\\theta}) = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{\\sum_i I_i(\\hat{\\theta})}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2079em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.0514em;vertical-align:-1.73em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.11em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3141em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3.8em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:1em;\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.162em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2741em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.8em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:1.02em;height:1.88em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.88em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1944\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M983 90\nl0 -0\nc4,-6.7,10,-10,18,-10 H400000v40\nH1013.1s-83.4,268,-264.1,840c-180.7,572,-277,876.3,-289,913c-4.7,4.7,-12.7,7,-24,7\ns-12,0,-12,0c-1.3,-3.3,-3.7,-11.7,-7,-25c-35.3,-125.3,-106.7,-373.3,-214,-744\nc-10,12,-21,25,-33,39s-32,39,-32,39c-6,-5.3,-15,-14,-27,-26s25,-30,25,-30\nc26.7,-32.7,52,-63,76,-91s52,-60,52,-60s208,722,208,722\nc56,-175.3,126.3,-397.3,211,-666c84.7,-268.7,153.8,-488.2,207.5,-658.5\nc53.7,-170.3,84.5,-266.8,92.5,-289.5z\nM1001 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.5259em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.5441em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3141em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.9911em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.73em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>每答对一道偏难的题，能力估计上移、下一题随之变难；答错则反向。这种&quot;步步紧逼&quot;使精度以最快速度累积。</p>\n<p>但纯最大信息法有副作用：高区分度题会被反复选中，导致少数&quot;好题&quot;过度曝光、加速泄露，而大半题库闲置。实务因此引入曝光控制（exposure control，如 Sympson-Hetter 法，给热门题加随机抑制）与内容平衡约束（保证各知识领域的题目配比，而非只挑信息最大的）。下表对比几种选题策略的取舍：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>选题策略</th>\n<th>目标</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>最大信息法</td>\n<td>精度最快收敛</td>\n<td>题量最省</td>\n<td>题目曝光不均、易泄露</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加曝光控制</td>\n<td>平衡精度与安全</td>\n<td>保护题库</td>\n<td>略增题量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>加内容平衡</td>\n<td>兼顾构念覆盖</td>\n<td>内容效度更稳</td>\n<td>牺牲部分信息效率</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>贝叶斯(后验加权)</td>\n<td>早期估计更稳</td>\n<td>起步抖动小</td>\n<td>受先验影响</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"能力估计与停止规则\">能力估计与停止规则</h2><p>每次作答后都要更新对 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span></span></span></span> 的估计。常用最大似然估计（MLE），但它有个尴尬：当作答者全对或全错时似然无极值、估不出来，因此 CAT 早期常改用贝叶斯方法——期望后验（EAP）或最大后验（MAP），借先验分布在数据稀薄的开局给出稳定估计，随题目增多再逐渐被数据主导。</p>\n<p>何时停？三类停止规则：固定长度（答满 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 题即停，简单但未必精度均等）、固定精度（一直答到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SE(\\hat{\\theta})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2079em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 降到阈值以下，保证每人精度一致但题量因人而异）、以及二者结合的混合规则（设精度目标同时设题量上限，防止难以收敛者无限作答）。高利害选拔多用固定精度以确保公平，时间受限场景则倾向固定长度。</p>\n<h2 id=\"优势-代价与公平\">优势、代价与公平</h2><p>CAT 的好处不止省时：因为每个人都被分到逼近其水平的题，作答体验更合理（高手不被简单题烦、新手不被难题击溃），且测量精度在全能力范围更均匀。但它也带来独特挑战——需要昂贵的预标定题库与稳定的施测平台；不同人做不同题引出可比性与公平问题：必须确认题库不含对特定群体不利的题，否则自适应会放大偏差。这把 CAT 直接连到项目功能差异检验（见 <a href=\"measurement-invariance-dif\">测量等价性与项目功能差异</a>）与测验公平伦理（见 <a href=\"../statistics-frontiers/test-bias-fairness-ethics\">测验偏差、公平与伦理</a>）。</p>\n<p>值得一提的前沿：随着计算心理测量发展，多维 CAT、融合过程数据（反应时等）与机器学习选题策略的探索正活跃推进，详见 <a href=\"../statistics-frontiers/computational-psychometrics-ml\">计算心理测量与机器学习</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>CAT 是&quot;选最优题→作答→更新能力估计→判停&quot;的实时循环，用更少题量达到同等精度，建立在 IRT 之上。</li>\n<li>题库须预先标定到同一量尺、在全能力范围充足且在关键决策点加厚，并靠等值维护新旧题可比。</li>\n<li>选题经典用最大信息法（在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>θ</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat\\theta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9579em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">θ</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2634em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 处信息最大），但须加曝光控制防泄露、加内容平衡保覆盖。</li>\n<li>能力估计开局常用贝叶斯（EAP/MAP）以稳住全对全错情形，后期由数据主导。</li>\n<li>停止规则分固定长度、固定精度与混合；高利害选拔多用固定精度保公平。</li>\n<li>CAT 省时且精度更均匀，但需昂贵题库与平台，并因人异题引出公平问题，连接 DIF 与伦理。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"计算机化自适应测验（CAT）","id":"计算机化自适应测验-cat"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：一个实时循环","id":"核心概念-一个实时循环"},{"level":2,"text":"题库：CAT 的弹药","id":"题库-cat-的弹药"},{"level":2,"text":"选题：每一步都挑最有信息量的题","id":"选题-每一步都挑最有信息量的题"},{"level":2,"text":"能力估计与停止规则","id":"能力估计与停止规则"},{"level":2,"text":"优势、代价与公平","id":"优势-代价与公平"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"项目反应理论（IRT）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/psychometrics/modern-measurement/item-response-theory"},"next":{"title":"测量等价性与项目功能差异（DIF）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/psychometrics/modern-measurement/measurement-invariance-dif"}}